{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step onto the lush &amp; relaxing world of\u00a0<strong>Putt in Parks</strong>, the most chill minigolf experience set in stunning, stylized landscapes. Embrace the delightfully melancholy &amp; explore Putt in Parks' relaxing yet challenging courses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212050/extras/777c96e8dec2404b8372f14f627c9ffa.avif?t=1773173644\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212050/extras_big/777c96e8dec2404b8372f14f627c9ffa.avif?t=1773173644 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Charming Courses:</strong> Wander through sun-dappled forests, a serene lakeside and a magical twilight mountain pass each lovingly crafted to inspire peace and wonder.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gentle Gameplay:</strong> Enjoy the simple pleasures of minigolf with intuitive controls, forgiving physics, and no timers. This is a game for those who want to take things at their own pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Walking Simulator Vibes:</strong> Roam the courses on foot experiencing the tranquil sights. Soak in the ambiance, listen to the birds, and let your mind drift.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replay &amp; Relax:</strong> Play a single hole, complete a full course, or just stroll around for the scenery. Perfect for a relaxing session after a busy day.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><br><br><strong>Grab a cup of coffee on a rainy day and enjoy Putt in Parks! </strong><br><br> <br><strong>Putt in Parks is a short relaxing stroll. Expect to spend roughly 1.5 hours to experience all the holes, and 5+ hours to master them all.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3212050?t=1773173644","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212050/4b356901da4b2458ec3093905d286380001b5fdc/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773173644","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212050/d7c6e937fa248b26af2246a7a8f6611097be3659/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773173644","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212050/d7c6e937fa248b26af2246a7a8f6611097be3659/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773173644","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3761670,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step onto the lush &amp; relaxing world of\u00a0<strong>Putt in Parks</strong>, the most chill minigolf experience set in stunning, stylized landscapes. Embrace the delightfully melancholy &amp; explore Putt in Parks' relaxing yet challenging courses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212050/extras/777c96e8dec2404b8372f14f627c9ffa.avif?t=1773173644\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212050/extras_big/777c96e8dec2404b8372f14f627c9ffa.avif?t=1773173644 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Charming Courses:</strong> Wander through sun-dappled forests, a serene lakeside and a magical twilight mountain pass each lovingly crafted to inspire peace and wonder.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gentle Gameplay:</strong> Enjoy the simple pleasures of minigolf with intuitive controls, forgiving physics, and no timers. This is a game for those who want to take things at their own pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Walking Simulator Vibes:</strong> Roam the courses on foot experiencing the tranquil sights. Soak in the ambiance, listen to the birds, and let your mind drift.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replay &amp; Relax:</strong> Play a single hole, complete a full course, or just stroll around for the scenery. Perfect for a relaxing session after a busy day.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><br><br><strong>Grab a cup of coffee on a rainy day and enjoy Putt in Parks! </strong><br><br> <br><strong>Putt in Parks is a short relaxing stroll. Expect to spend roughly 1.5 hours to experience all the holes, and 5+ hours to master them all.</strong></p>","developers":["tinyaxe"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212050/3c792353eb55df6e9abc4c283bf2ae3899ea9655/header.jpg?t=1773173644","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu, Debian, etc<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> RX570<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core M<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstat